    "original_url": "https://goobjoog.com/2026/10/08/17-wasiir-iyo-2-raiisul-wasaare-ku-xigeen-oo-wajahaya-kala-doorashada-xildhibaannimada-iyo-wasiirnimada/",
    "country": "Somalia",
